  "limits": [
    "Rows 81–240 per author code; excluded source run 1 is not treated as another independent run.",
    "34 cores have >10 recovered seed records despite nominal 10 planted; do not model as binomial with nominal n=10 or interpret recovered fractions as per-sown establishment. Germination count per nominal ten is only a scaling sensitivity.",
    "Water bath shared within temperature/run; conditional block bootstrap does not generalize thermal effects beyond two runs.",
    "Burial is post-treatment; arithmetic decomposition is not causal mediation, and no seed survival or emergence after removal was measured.",
    "Recovered-seed germination includes all recovered seed records in denominator; source precomputed germination percentages differ, possibly due to viability denominators. Distinct estimand; not a reproduction of original significance tests.",
    "Exploratory unadjusted comparisons, no evidence of equivalence where interval crosses zero."
  ]
